Schema requirements:
- Preserve barcode leading zeros.
- Model conflicting identifier claims rather than silently overwriting.
- Label snapshots are immutable; corrections create a revision/correction record.
- Unknown ingredient matches remain explicit.
- Store source attribution and applicable license metadata.
- Version rules and evidence so old assessments can be explained.
- Index for barcode resolution, product/variant lookup, scans by user/time, findings by assessment, evidence by ingredient/category/jurisdiction.
- Use paginated queries and bounded document sizes.
- Confirm exact index syntax against the installed Convex version.
