- Category and jurisdiction.
- API terms/licensing/attribution.
- Authentication, rate limits and refresh cadence.
- Parsing/schema validation.
- Deduplication/content hashing.
- Error handling and source health.
- Human review requirements for consequential rules.
Candidate sources to evaluate (not blanket endorsements or complete safety databases):
- Open Food Facts: https://openfoodfacts.github.io/documentation/docs/Product-Opener/api/
- USDA FoodData Central: https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-guide/
- FDA food ingredient/additive resources: https://www.fda.gov/food/food-ingredients-packaging/food-additives-petitions
- European Commission CosIng: https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/sectors/cosmetics/cosmetic-ingredient-database_en
